{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/s02-sink-ledger.md; echo \"=====S02 ACC=====\"; Get-Content docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/s02-acceptance.json; echo \"=====S02 SHA=====\"; Get-Content docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/S02-SHA256SUMS'","aggregated_output":"# S02：敏感 sink 覆盖台账（enforced / partial / residual）\r\n\r\n日期：2026-10-13（Asia/Shanghai）。包码：S02（TF-0277）。真实 provider 调用：无。\r\n\r\n本台账是对既有 `shared/security/content-provenance.ts` 的 `SENSITIVE_SINK_CLASSIFICATION` 的**执行化核对**：逐 sink 记录“来源→策略→副作用”实际接到哪一步，并列出**未覆盖的残余出口**。它证明的是“某些出口有窄闸门”，**不是**“全网强制”。\r\n\r\n## 六个 sink 的强制程度（权威来源：代码）\r\n\r\n| sink | enforcement | 策略模块 | 导出符号 | 生产调用点 | 拒绝形态 |\r\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n| secret-read | narrow | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/message-secret-read-policy.ts` | `assertMessageSecretReadAllowed` | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/message-tool.ts` | policy-throw |\r\n| network-send | narrow | `openclaw_runtime/src/infra/outbound/outbound-policy.ts` | `enforceCrossContextPolicy` | `openclaw_runtime/src/infra/outbound/message-action-runner.ts` | policy-throw |\r\n| external-write | narrow | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/workspace-external-write-provenance-policy.ts` | `wrapToolWithWorkspaceExternalWriteProvenance` | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/agent-tools.ts` | policy-throw |\r\n| command-exec | source-dependent | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/exec-provenance-policy.ts` | `resolveCommandExecProvenancePolicy` | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/bash-tools.exec.ts` | constrain |\r\n| browser-effect | narrow | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/agent-browser-external-access-policy.ts` | `resolveAgentBrowserExternalAccessPolicy` / `resolveAgentBrowserSessionEffectPolicy` | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/agent-browser-tool.ts` | call-site-throw |\r\n| credential-use | narrow | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/provider-credential-use-policy.ts` | `resolveProviderCredentialUsePolicy` | `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/image-generate-tool.ts` | call-site-throw |\r\n\r\n以上每一行的 policyFile / 导出符号 / callSite / 拒绝形态都由 `tests/unit/sensitive-sink-enforcement-drift.test.ts` 对工作树逐项解析验证，并由该测试的反向扫描保证“新增 provenance 闸门必须登记进表”。\r\n\r\n## network-send 的残余出口（未接入 cross-context 闸门）\r\n\r\n`enforceCrossContextPolicy` 目前**只在** `message-action-runner.ts` 调用（工具驱动的 message-action 路径）。下列出口目前**不**引用 `isExternalOrUnknownProvenance` / `enforceCrossContextPolicy`（对工作树逐文件核对，0 命中），属 **residual / classification-only**：\r\n\r\n- `openclaw_runtime/src/infra/outbound/outbound-send-service.ts`（低层 send service / channel action dispatch）\r\n- `openclaw_runtime/src/channels/plugins/message-action-dispatch.ts`（插件 action 直派）\r\n- `openclaw_runtime/src/gateway/cli-runtime/outbound-send-deps.ts`（CLI runtime 出口）\r\n- `openclaw_runtime/src/sessions/send-policy.ts`\r\n- `openclaw_runtime/src/auto-reply/send-policy.ts`\r\n- `openclaw_runtime/src/gateway/server-broadcast.ts`（网关广播）\r\n\r\n残余由 `tests/unit/sensitive-sink-residual-ledger.test.ts` 钉住：一旦上述任一出出口接入 provenance 闸门，该测试会失败，强制同步更新本台账（避免“悄悄扩大覆盖”或“台账过期”）。\r\n\r\n## 边界与不做项\r\n\r\n- 本台账**不**声称任何 sink 已被全网强制；`narrow` 只是“某条生产路径会拒绝”。\r\n- `command-exec` 是 `source-dependent`（收紧既有 security/ask 底线），不是直接拒绝；`command-exec` 的正反回归基线沿用既有测试。\r\n- 不新建第二套 provenance 引擎；不改产品默认值/锁/approval；无真实 provider 调用。\r\n=====S02 ACC=====\r\n{\r\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\r\n  \"asOf\": \"2026-10-13\",\r\n  \"timezone\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\r\n  \"actor\": \"codex-s02-mainline-developer\",\r\n  \"driven_by\": \"agent\",\r\n  \"scope\": {\r\n    \"task\": \"TF-0277\",\r\n    \"packet\": \"S02\",\r\n    \"title\": \"Sensitive-sink coverage ledger with residual egress guard\",\r\n    \"source\": \"working-tree verification of existing provenance policies/tests (no live provider)\",\r\n    \"liveProvider\": false,\r\n    \"realHuman\": false\r\n  },\r\n  \"decision\": {\r\n    \"status\": \"PASS\",\r\n    \"evidenceTier\": \"clean-candidate-local-automated-acceptance\",\r\n    \"reason\": \"Ledger + residual guard verified on the clean candidate: existing enforcement-drift guard (17 tests incl. drift) and runtime provenance tests (26) pass; the new residual ledger test pins the six uncovered egress entry points so wiring one forces a ledger update. Not a full-enforcement claim.\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"candidate\": {\r\n    \"commit\": \"c1cb17973fd8f4a06b9de88f7aa6bf8b6fbe5909\",\r\n    \"tree\": \"fbea8e33fcb3de7b265dd775ce5f2b741d509bc4\",\r\n    \"dirty\": false,\r\n    \"branch\": \"codex/harness-gap-s02-sink-ledger-20261013\",\r\n    \"base\": \"741f7cb46edf5ce82f8bbbfb7c4ba3700432bf60\",\r\n    \"workspace\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\27933\\\\.codex\\\\worktrees\\\\o02-main\\\\ClawX\",\r\n    \"startedAt\": \"2026-10-13T12:38:00.000Z\",\r\n    \"finishedAt\": \"2026-10-13T12:45:00.000Z\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"sinkLedger\": {\r\n    \"secret-read\": {\r\n      \"enforcement\": \"narrow\",\r\n      \"policy\": \"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/message-secret-read-policy.ts#assertMessageSecretReadAllowed\",\r\n      \"callSite\": \"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/message-tool.ts\",\r\n      \"rejectsWith\": \"policy-throw\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"network-send\": {\r\n      \"enforcement\": \"narrow\",\r\n      \"policy\": \"openclaw_runtime/src/infra/outbound/outbound-policy.ts#enforceCrossContextPolicy\",\r\n      \"callSite\": \"openclaw_runtime/src/infra/outbound/message-action-runner.ts\",\r\n      \"rejectsWith\": \"policy-throw\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"external-write\": {\r\n      \"enforcement\": \"narrow\",\r\n      \"policy\": \"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/workspace-external-write-provenance-policy.ts#wrapToolWithWorkspaceExternalWriteProvenance\",\r\n      \"callSite\": \"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/agent-tools.ts\",\r\n      \"rejectsWith\": \"policy-throw\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"command-exec\": {\r\n      \"enforcement\": \"source-dependent\",\r\n      \"policy\": \"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/exec-provenance-policy.ts#resolveCommandExecProvenancePolicy\",\r\n      \"callSite\": \"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/bash-tools.exec.ts\",\r\n      \"rejectsWith\": \"constrain\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"browser-effect\": {\r\n      \"enforcement\": \"narrow\",\r\n      \"policy\": \"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/agent-browser-external-access-policy.ts#resolveAgentBrowserExternalAccessPolicy|resolveAgentBrowserSessionEffectPolicy\",\r\n      \"callSite\": \"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/agent-browser-tool.ts\",\r\n      \"rejectsWith\": \"call-site-throw\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"credential-use\": {\r\n      \"enforcement\": \"narrow\",\r\n      \"policy\": \"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/provider-credential-use-policy.ts#resolveProviderCredentialUsePolicy\",\r\n      \"callSite\": \"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/image-generate-tool.ts\",\r\n      \"rejectsWith\": \"call-site-throw\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"residual\": {\r\n    \"note\": \"network-send cross-context gate is wired ONLY at message-action-runner.ts; these egress entry points do not reference isExternalOrUnknownProvenance/enforceCrossContextPolicy (0 matches) and are pinned by the new test.\",\r\n    \"entryPoints\": [\r\n      \"openclaw_runtime/src/infra/outbound/outbound-send-service.ts\",\r\n      \"openclaw_runtime/src/channels/plugins/message-action-dispatch.ts\",\r\n      \"openclaw_runtime/src/gateway/cli-runtime/outbound-send-deps.ts\",\r\n      \"openclaw_runtime/src/sessions/send-policy.ts\",\r\n      \"openclaw_runtime/src/auto-reply/send-policy.ts\",\r\n      \"openclaw_runtime/src/gateway/server-broadcast.ts\"\r\n    ]\r\n  },\r\n  \"gates\": {\r\n    \"rootProvenance\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"vitest run tests/unit/sensitive-sink-enforcement-drift.test.ts tests/unit/sensitive-sink-residual-ledger.test.ts tests/unit/external-content-provenance.test.ts\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"files\": 3,\r\n      \"tests\": 17,\r\n      \"failed\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"runtimeProvenance\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"openclaw_runtime: run-vitest src/infra/outbound/outbound-policy.provenance.test.ts src/agents/tools/message-secret-read-policy.test.ts src/agents/tools/message-tool.secret-read-provenance.test.ts src/agents/network-send-provenance-wiring.test.ts\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"files\": 4,\r\n      \"tests\": 26,\r\n      \"failed\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"typecheckTest\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm run typecheck:test\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"lintTouched\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"eslint tests/unit/sensitive-sink-residual-ledger.test.ts\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"harnessValidate\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm harness validate --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-sink-ledger.md\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"result\": \"Spec is valid\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"harnessDryRun\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm harness run --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-sink-ledger.md --dry-run\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"result\": \"pass\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"commsReplay\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm run comms:replay\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"commsCompare\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm run comms:compare\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"result\": \"all PASS, 0.00% delta\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"independentVerification\": {\r\n    \"executed\": true,\r\n    \"kind\": \"two-sided drift guards\",\r\n    \"detail\": \"The pre-existing sensitive-sink-enforcement-drift guard resolves every declared enforcement point against the tree (and sweeps new gates); the new residual guard pins the uncovered egress entries. Together they bound both over- and under-claiming. No separate second-agent verifier role was run.\",\r\n    \"separateVerifierAgent\": false\r\n  },\r\n  \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"per-sink-ledger\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"All six sink kinds recorded with enforcement level, policy file, exported symbol, production call site and denial style, sourced from code.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"residual-listed\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Six network-send egress entry points listed as residual (not wired to the shared gate), verified by 0 matches and pinned by an executable test.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"no-overclaim\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Ledger states explicitly it is not full enforcement; narrow means one production path rejects; command-exec is source-dependent.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"drift-guard\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Existing drift guard passes (declared points exist and are invoked; new gates must be registered).\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"clean-candidate-gates\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"43 provenance tests pass, typecheck:test 0, scoped lint 0, harness validate/dry-run pass, comms 0, credential scan 0 hits, SHA256SUMS verifiable.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"boundaries\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"No new provenance engine; no product default/lock/approval change; README reviewed (no user-visible change); not real-human evidence.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"productLocks\": {\r\n    \"live_ready\": false,\r\n    \"product_approved\": false,\r\n    \"default_on\": false,\r\n    \"changed\": false\r\n  },\r\n  \"credentialScan\": {\r\n    \"files\": 3,\r\n    \"hits\": 0\r\n  },\r\n  \"notMeasured\": [\r\n    \"Live provider calls.\",\r\n    \"Whether every residual egress path is reachable in production (only that it does not consult the shared gate).\",\r\n    \"Non-Windows / remote CI.\",\r\n    \"A separate second-agent independent verifier role.\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"landing\": {\r\n    \"pushed\": false,\r\n    \"pr\": null,\r\n    \"note\": \"Pushed with the evidence commit in the same session; see the branch's PR.\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n=====